==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Doublade|108}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*'''Dual Blades''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|XY|Doublade|84}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

